{"abstract":"Flexible electricity networks continuously coordinate and optimize operations through ICT systems. An overlay data grid conveys information about the state of the electricity grid, including the real-time status of demand and production. Data is thus the basis for decisions that affect electricity costs and availability of assets. It is crucial that these decisions are formed and monitored according to a well-defined governance model. No such data governance model exists today. In this paper, we focus on data governance in virtual power plants. We define the problem, insisting on the issues linked to the inherent asymmetry of this system. We propose unionization as a framing device to reason about these issues. The central contribution of this paper is a set of principles for a unionized data governance model for virtual power plants.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Ørbæk Chemnitz, Niels","Bonnet, Philippe","Büttrich, Sebastian","Shklovski, Irina","Watts, Laura"],"cuid":["S02-096.51-038282"],"filters":{"added":"2022-04","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","University of Edinburgh"],"keyword":["Aggregators","Data governance","Personal data","Power Asymmetries","Virtual power plant"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"unionized data governance in virtual power plants poster","src":["itu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/86062447/CR_Poster_UnionizedDataGovernanceInVirtualPowerPlants.pdf","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S02-096.51-038282","identifier":[{"id":"85109351327","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-33462cc4-cab0-41ce-9997-1b81fb2b1d91","ku-0883e533-cbe0-47ba-a1f5-383fa259dcae"],"keyword":["Aggregators","Data Governance","Personal Data","Power Asymmetries","Virtual Power Plant"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-689F7B0EF251762C1DD47D7D96CF5684"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"loc","url":"https://pure.itu.dk/ws/files/86062447/CR_Poster_UnionizedDataGovernanceInVirtualPowerPlants.pdf","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Data, Systems, and Robotics, Data-intensive Systems and Applications"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Science, Department of Computer Science, Human-Centred Computing"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"gb","key":"university of edinburgh","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"University of Edinburgh","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Niels Ørbæk","key":"chemnitzpau","last":"Chemnitz","name":"Chemnitz, Niels Ørbæk","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Philippe","key":"bonnetpau","last":"Bonnet","locid":"19e8d8f1-16b3-457d-b02b-89d9ce850c30","name":"Bonnet, Philippe","orcid":"0000-0002-0234-5374","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","first":"Irina","key":"shklovskipau","last":"Shklovski","locid":"e5067505-4088-4c76-b398-aedd455ed164","name":"Shklovski, Irina","orcid":"0000-0003-1874-0958","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sebastian","key":"büttrichpau","last":"Büttrich","locid":"c649bf10-5588-4d10-8c7c-471874cf98f9","name":"Büttrich, Sebastian","orcid":"0000-0002-7997-3002","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","first":"Laura","key":"wattspau","last":"Watts","name":"Watts, Laura","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3447555.3466570","edition":"e-Energy '21","eisbn":["9781450383332"],"isbn":["9781450383332"],"pages":"282-283","place":"New York, NY, USA","publisher":"Association for Computing Machinery","status":"p","subtitle":"e-Energy '21","title":"Proceedings of the Twelfth ACM International Conference on Future Energy Systems"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-85109351327"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-33462cc4-cab0-41ce-9997-1b81fb2b1d91","ku-0883e533-cbe0-47ba-a1f5-383fa259dcae"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Unionized Data Governance in Virtual Power Plants: Poster","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-096.51-038282","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"Flexible electricity networks continuously coordinate and optimize operations through ICT systems. An overlay data grid conveys information about the state of the electricity grid, as well as the status of demand and production of electricity in households and industry. Data is thus the basis for decisions that affect electricity costs and availability of assets on the electricity grid. It is crucial that these decisions are formed and monitored according to a well-defined governance model. No such data governance model exist today. In this paper, we focus on the central role of virtual power plants in flexible electricity networks. We define the problem of data governance in a virtual power plant, insisting on the issues linked to the inherent asymmetry of this system. We propose unionization as a framing device to reason about this issue. The central contribution of this paper is thus principles for a unionized data governance model for virtual power plants.","author_count":5,"contributors":["Chemnitz, Niels Ørbæk","Bonnet, Philippe","Shklovski, Irina","Büttrich, Sebastian","Watts, Laura"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384314"],"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Data governance","Energy networks","Unions","Virtual power plants"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"unionized data governance in virtual power plants","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dw","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.02709","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384314","ids":["itu-cfc2dd2c-0955-4188-b062-8c900d5a000e"],"keyword":["Data Governance","Energy Networks","Unions","Virtual Power Plants"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-AE2E04A6B81CC25070EF41D040B48B47"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2006.02709","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Computer Science","IT University of Copenhagen, Data, Systems, and Robotics, Data-intensive Systems and Applications"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Niels Ørbæk","key":"chemnitzpau","last":"Chemnitz","name":"Chemnitz, Niels Ørbæk","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Philippe","key":"bonnetpau","last":"Bonnet","locid":"19e8d8f1-16b3-457d-b02b-89d9ce850c30","name":"Bonnet, Philippe","orcid":"0000-0002-0234-5374","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Irina","key":"shklovskipau","last":"Shklovski","name":"Shklovski, Irina","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Sebastian","key":"büttrichpau","last":"Büttrich","locid":"c649bf10-5588-4d10-8c7c-471874cf98f9","name":"Büttrich, Sebastian","orcid":"0000-0002-7997-3002","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"Laura","key":"wattspau","last":"Watts","name":"Watts, Laura","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"11","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-cfc2dd2c-0955-4188-b062-8c900d5a000e"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Unionized Data Governance in Virtual Power Plants","type":"Working Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-384314","year":"2020","yearsub":"2020"}
